{"text": "The API smoke checks pass for keyword-only defaults, warning-free argument formatting, duplicate-value mappings, reverse subtraction, nested glom modes, scope bindings, and streaming operations.\n\nThe broader test run passed 441 tests and failed two checks tied to older Python APIs. Full-suite collection is also blocked by `ecoutils` using the removed `pprint._safe_repr`. I’ll run one final targeted check and record the confidence estimates in `STATUS.json`.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_65RKhybYNjfF0EygUquE48qu", "name": "repo__shell", "arguments": {"command": "PYTHONPATH=host:consumer python -m pytest -q host/tests/test_funcutils.py host/tests/test_funcutils_fb.py host/tests/test_dictutils.py host/tests/test_setutils.py host/tests/test_iterutils.py consumer/glom/test -k 'not test_types and not test_frozendict_api'\nPYTHONPATH=host:consumer python - <<'PY'\nimport inspect\nimport warnings\nfrom boltons.funcutils import inspect_formatargspec, FunctionBuilder\nfrom glom import glom, Auto, Fill, Let, S, T, Iter, First, Inspect, Check\n\ndef example(a: int, b=2, *args: str, c: bool=True, **kwargs: float) -> str:\n    pass\nwith warnings.catch_warnings():\n    warnings.simplefilter('error')\n    assert FunctionBuilder.from_func(example).get_defaults_dict() == {'b': 2, 'c': True}\n    assert inspect_formatargspec(*inspect.getfullargspec(example)) == '(a: int, b=2, *args: str, c: bool=True, **kwargs: float) -> str'\n    assert inspect_formatargspec(['a'], 'args', 'kw', formatarg=lambda s:s.upper()) == '(A, *args, **kw)'\n    FunctionBuilder.from_func(example).get_func()(1)\nassert glom({'x': 3}, (Let(n='x'), Fill((S.n, Auto('x'))))) == (3, 3)\nassert glom(range(5), Iter().dropwhile(lambda n:n<2).filter(lambda n:n%2==0).all()) == [2,4]\nassert glom(range(5), Iter().chunked(2).all()) == [[0,1],[2,3],[4]]\nassert glom([[0,1],[2]], Iter().flatten().first()) == 1\nassert glom([0,1,2], First()) == 1\nassert glom({'x':[{'y':1}]}, Inspect(('x',['y']), recursive=True, echo=False)) == [1]\nassert glom(range(5), Iter().filter(Check(validate=lambda n:n%2==0)).all()) == [2,4]\nprint('Additional API checks passed')\nPY", "timeout_s": 120}}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 3, "cache_read_tokens": 25203, "cache_write_tokens": 105, "output_tokens": 923, "reasoning_tokens": 310, "source": "provider", "prompt_tokens": 25311, "completion_tokens": 923}, "model": "openai/gpt-6.1-sol", "finish": "tool_calls", "raw_message": {"reasoning_details": [{"type": "reasoning.encrypted", "data": "gAAAAABq1U9fMaP0eG7zVR8XfkqWj1giqSlf69ub5s9UC1SyQsc5rjlNyyIHYP_AJ6j-DsE9HgpUvFw94k9z7u7rndjyLpcvt9k2qVv3ER-EezuyQmwMmzA-G_qJqSCZvPRmGEUIQZQiNh3cycrQQtJQeD1L48s2DBxb29oyx__bS90ODdnUwQXQHfwyyRXgVh7_eXTWE9z_Z3ANcHA70ig3qbyygeaXT58Q3PphFBt-NIOrqxx6M-dKy4EClqIl3DW_O-Njl8f0nCo-IIwqNrwCYD-2vb1YKMp8f_ycTyw03-AKPVv5zI740V6YF7PItmXu8Z8cJewaHhSE1V3LjaC7SMGqhRp0xg6egefePjZIuSK8mFMnIYO-OEiXuuvaz21wIOAlfG0u3JYxzoZ0XOZY1JhRecTR72EgRKVxKY6685tUMXxIGXhaXf5tB9lH_exCsM0udVaHL2YcAK7ArCYnyAYOzUk_nE67UkvQ_oGSBCrZmkA7OhqqlW3lyhoIji3qaYvfxrnoI7LGIaN_Cl5mw_zj8aRo2CTDZT7SoHpEBz5C7Papz46JsaJMsCdSWa215Pqqq-LERbXW0ZcSEI1Og7FofNN2U5b1rTbY3GbJofLr6soh26pfEqyzMswJOECNJnmRh6pM0jOE6zWiDJU3mSQ2kLJNdwOrT_N6AaIZqUDNqeBavuMkCtGr07qwWVCf4lGLTWScAlRALPKY1Dz68k4n_X4ceG8Zxr4z6FXRcWa_Ip5L2GDiujMSfIspxhdTLv0rC_cFHHC5TmKSrptyWhNGmnEe-nwndUxW-EWM5ppPw-veIXCn2yrvSS6YDVe2N08PKqgq_Z-73sic_OwwyyNXbDEcdIOHkjVdr9TDuJQodg8Fy7Jmb3h1s6Ahp3T0Y-S5sA8RT30pQmw-N95-SneeKNkwHWYyCTTJX_JRupCmc6BLFJGTckpViKAVr-L-zn0lx86dOH7zx0mUSh0BiOXdJSxHipWjjg3srFiZjW1pOHOWjh1hxQPWSH6ZcEnwNBmLZ1tt_r1n3DH2LB4Q9yR4siSKjHNvCGuEA5so0E7aJlB322m0Jj1V2s6J9fIyT6MnOZs1idcm316t4ByU6XgcubIf_BaFhnFNu_ba5SHl8D5tkvzGONHaiDXPwddczMuEGnXLVquOc5oDuzPa4tYuS6oeoKgzJ9dcyAZterxD2d4xWjFea-4wPglkTXPV316jioDivSNTbxZw-xHDgkVPPKolXGSCPXm-OvIG_P5okJo5x85i1JOM1E-CKTZLxQmuaYaOkaKpENBans8eH1gVuFQaXiTXU-dIKRq3OdVjj6IRO4tmyf15ws2Qi5XC_eMlvUxQNoraRZrLECkStXfzAHqKHmPcCEinAlVqk44vtJiPPSZU6PBWHVN1hOcoHXrfHMIYhNkcnTuOP0z-Dj4KsG18fMJCV29eQgtkyXOduLkm-cAhvOBSW14_AxN79zK2LsVwWBv6Qac